<div class="how-block"><h2>How to tell whether a link will work</h2><p>Three checks cover almost every failed download, whatever the platform:</p><ul><li><strong>It must point to one media item.</strong> Profile, channel, playlist, hashtag, feed and search pages do not identify a single video.</li><li><strong>It must be public.</strong> Open the link in a private browser window. If the platform asks you to sign in, Save-Froms cannot process it either.</li><li><strong>It must be finished.</strong> Live streams, Spaces and premieres that have not started are not downloadable files until the replay is published.</li></ul><p>If a link passes all three and still fails, the <a href="{{ url('/download-troubleshooting') }}">troubleshooting guide</a> explains each error message, and the <a href="{{ url('/how-to-download-videos') }}">how-to guide</a> walks through the full workflow on every device.</p></div>

